    <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span
    style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
    "Times New Roman"'><br>
    <b>
    <label class=textogrupo>
     Salários, Reajustes e Pagamento <br style='mso-special-character:line-break'>
     <![if !supportLineBreakNewLine]><br style='mso-special-character:line-break'>
     <![endif]></b><o:p></o:p></span></p>
     <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b>
     <label class=textosubgrupo>
     </label>
     <span style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     "Times New Roman"'>Piso Salarial <br style='mso-special-character:line-break'>
     <![if !supportLineBreakNewLine]><br style='mso-special-character:line-break'>
     <![endif]></span></b><span style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
     mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
     <p class=MsoNormal><b><span style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
     mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><br>
    </label>
    <label class=tituloClausula>
     CLÁUSULA TERCEIRA - PISO SALARIAL <br>
     </span></b><span style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
     mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><br style='mso-special-character:
     line-break'>
     <![if !supportLineBreakNewLine]><br style='mso-special-character:line-break'>
     <![endif]><o:p></o:p></span></p>
    </label>
    <p style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:
    "Arial",sans-serif'>
    <label class=descricaoClausula>
     Ficam estipulados os seguintes salários <span class=SpellE>deingresso</span>
     desde que cumprida integralmente, ou compensada a jornada de trabalho de
     44 (quarenta e quatro) horas semanais, a partir de <strong><span
     style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>1º de maio de 2024</span></strong>:<o:p></o:p></span></p>
     <p style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:
     "Arial",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
     <p><span style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
     <table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0
      style='mso-cellspacing:0cm;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184;mso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm'>
